n enumerate(page.items):\n        if checkpoint_read((page.id, idx)) is not None:\n            continue  # skip already-pushed\n        client.push(item, token=token)\n        checkpoint_write((page.id, idx))\n```\n\nThe trade-off: per-item checkpoints are slower but survive mid-page failures; per-page checkpoints are faster but force replays.","ttft_ms":6253,"ttft_stream_ms":1572,"time_to_request_ms":15,"type":"result","duration_ms":9576,"uuid":"bc84a129-c9e0-4bf3-ac56-24a8ea3781f8"}
